{"n":102,"ar":"التكاثر","tr":"At-Takathur","en":"The Rivalry in world increase","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"أَلۡهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","Alhakumu alttakathuru","Rivalry in worldly increase distracteth you"],[2,"حَتَّىٰ زُرۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَقَابِرَ","Hatta zurtumu almaqabira","Until ye come to the graves"],[3,"كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","Kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","Nay, but ye will come to know"],[4,"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","Nay, but ye will come to know"],[5,"كَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عِلۡمَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeeni","Nay, would that ye knew (now) with a sure knowledge"],[6,"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","Latarawunna aljaheema","For ye will behold hell-fire"],[7,"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيۡنَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeeni","Aye, ye will behold it with sure vision"],[8,"ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","Thumma latusalunna yawmaithin AAani alnnaAAeemi","Then, on that day, ye will be asked concerning pleasure"]]}